  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhanced Quality Legal Aid Services (EQUALS)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to enhance access to justice for women and men in Albania and North Macedonia as part of their EU integration process by improving the quality and effectiveness of the free legal aid (FLA) system. It will leverage lessons from the ongoing Access to Justice (A2J) project implemented in Albania with funding from the Austrian Development Cooperation (ADC), focusing on supporting women and disadvantaged groups in seeking justice.</narrative>
  </description>
